      "writtenOn": "2026-08-31T07:04:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@paligill@gmail.com  Because the PT5161 driver is not ready (bound) when the EEPROM service starts, it cannot retrieve the version at that point. \nIt waits for the notification flow triggered by a HostState change.",
      "parentUuid": "38aeae5d_221d0e1c",
      "revId": "b62e6193aaaedb8871f01772f146672901a82150",
