      "message": "Could we add a retry (or delayed re-query) when the initial hostPower.getState(ctx) call fails? If this startup query fails once and no further host-state transition occurs, version retrieval may still be skipped in the same race scenario this patch is addressing.",
      "revId": "b62e6193aaaedb8871f01772f146672901a82150",
